{
  "tema": 5772,
  "slug": "condicional-tener",
  "titulo": "Conjugate tener in the conditional",
  "subtitulo": "Tendría, tendrías, tendríamos: the future stem tendr- with the conditional endings.",
  "foto": "t08.jpg",
  "regla": "Tener has the irregular stem tendr- in the conditional, with the regular endings: tendría, tendrías, tendría, tendríamos, tendrían.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Tener** (_to have_) is irregular in the conditional (**el condicional simple**). It uses the same irregular stem as the future, **tendr-**, and the regular conditional endings."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "**tendr-**",
            "**-ía, -ías, -ía, -íamos, -ían**"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "tener"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "tendría"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "tendrías"
            ],
            [
              "él, ella, usted",
              "tendría"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros",
              "tendríamos"
            ],
            [
              "ustedes, ellos",
              "tendrían"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Verbs built on **tener** do the same: **mantener** → **mantendría**, **obtener** → **obtendría**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Every form has a written accent on the **í** of the ending."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: the **e** of **tener** falls out and a **d** holds the door: **ten-d-ría**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Yo ==tendría== un carro nuevo.",
              "en": "I'd have a new car."
            },
            {
              "es": "Tú ==tendrías== vacaciones para siempre.",
              "en": "You'd have endless vacations."
            },
            {
              "es": "Holden ==tendría== muchas admiradoras.",
              "en": "Holden would have lots of fans."
            },
            {
              "es": "Nosotros ==tendríamos== pocos amigos ahí.",
              "en": "We'd have few friends there."
            },
            {
              "es": "Ellos ==tendrían== un mejor currículum.",
              "en": "They'd have a better résumé."
            },
            {
              "es": "Ustedes ==tendrían== que viajar en camión.",
              "en": "You'd have to travel by bus."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
